## Setup

```bash
pixi install
pixi run setup          # CLAUDE.md, skill symlinks, and data/ dirs
pixi run export-conda   # environment.yml for conda users (optional)
```

## Workflow

Code matures by moving between folders — prototype in `exploratory/`, promote reusable logic
to `src/{{ package_name }}/`, finalize results as thin runnables in `analysis/` /
`preprocessing/`. **Dependencies point inward:** everything imports `src/`; `src/` imports
nothing local. See [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) for the full guide.

```bash
pixi run all       # full pipeline{% if include_simulations %} (simulate → preprocess → results){% else %} (preprocess → results){% endif %}
pixi run results   # just one stage (assumes data is built)
pixi run check     # lint + format-check + tests + conda-export freshness
pixi run format    # auto-format with ruff
```

## Layout

| Path | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `src/{{ package_name }}/` | the library — reusable logic, imported everywhere |
| `src/{{ package_name }}/io/` | external-data access, cache-on-first-use |
{% if include_simulations %}| `simulations/` | Tier 1: run models → `data/raw/` |
{% endif %}| `preprocessing/` | Tier 1: `data/raw` (+external) → `data/processed/` |
| `analysis/` | Tier 2: processed → figures/tables (`theory/` = data-free) |
| `exploratory/` | scratch `# %%` scripts |
| `tests/` | pytest, mirrors the package |
| `figures/` | rendered figures — committed deliverables |
| `data/` | datasets: raw/external/processed (gitignored) |

